notes: >
  §4.4: when generated output is gitignored the drift gate PASSES — ignored paths never appear in
  the replica's status — and materialization is the fixer's job. Half of "works whether generated
  code is committed or not"; go-generate-stale is the committed half.
requires: [go]
argv: ['--all']
exitCode: 0
gates:
  golang:generate: { status: pass }
